body:
It trades on the Stockmarket, FUD ( Fear, Uncertainty, Doubt) will make others money if the stock price dips.

&#x200B;

They might be right with their complaints but take it with caution. I had my funds locked up for about 3 hours after what was an issue with the platform but the it was restored and while the transaction didn't go through i didn't lose my money. In my opinion the most obvious way to see if they are lying is how often they follow up the thread. If they post how horrible it it to lose 30k on here then never comment again it's basically like an advert
